  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Bella Beach — your quintessential 30A escape nestled in the gated enclave of Palmeira Villas, just steps from world-famous emerald waters and sugar-white sand. This elevated coastal retreat blends relaxed beachside charm with upscale comfort, making it the perfect choice for multigenerational families, groups of friends, or anyone seeking a truly unforgettable South Walton vacation experience.<br><br>From the moment you arrive, you’ll appreciate the lush tropical landscaping and elegant Mediterranean-inspired façade that sets the tone for a memorable stay. Inside, this thoughtfully designed home welcomes you with light-filled spaces, stylish coastal décor, and premium finishes throughout — all curated to reflect the laid-back sophistication of 30A living. <br>Blue Swell<br><br>🏖️ Prime Location — Beach & Local Favorites<br>Located in the highly desirable Seagrove Beach community, Bella Beach is just a 4-minute walk to public beach access — so sandy toes and seaside sunsets are always within reach. When you’re ready to explore beyond the shore, enjoy easy walking access to local shops, cafes, and restaurants that give this coastal neighborhood its vibrant, welcoming spirit. <br><br>🛏️ Comfortable & Spacious Accommodations<br>This 4-bed, 4½-bath home sleeps up to 12 guests in thoughtful comfort:<br>- Two luxurious master suites — one on the second floor and another on the third — each offering privacy and peaceful escapes after sun-filled days. <br>- Upscale living areas with plush seating and natural light, perfect for gathering with loved ones. <br>- A fully equipped kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, ready for your beach-side feasts.<br><br>Whether you’re sipping morning coffee on the patio or sharing dinner around the farmhouse-style dining table, every corner of Bella Beach is made for connection and comfort. <br><br>🏊 Relax & Unwind — Private Plunge Pool<br>Step outside to your private plunge pool oasis, a refreshing place to cool off after a long day in the sun or simply relax beneath swaying palms. This tranquil outdoor retreat invites you to linger longer — whether you’re soaking up the Florida sun or stargazing by night. <br><br>🌟 Why Guests Love Bella Beach<br>Guests return year after year for the unbeatable combination of location, comfort, and coastal charm. With close proximity to 30A bike paths, nature trails, beach access, and Seaside’s iconic shopping and dining, Bella Beach is the ideal home base for your next Florida getaway. <br><br>✨ Book Your Stay<br>Experience the best of 30A at Bella Beach — where luxury meets laid-back beach life, and every day feels like a coastal celebration. <br><br>Perfect for family reunions, group vacations, or simply escaping to the Gulf for sun, surf, and serenity.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 12) <br>1ST FLOOR:<br>• Living Room: 1 Full Sleeper Sofa, dual-reclining couch<br>• Kitchen: stainless steel appliances, gas stove, granite countertops<br>• Dining Area: farmhouse table with seating for 8-10<br><br>2ND FLOOR:<br>• Master Bedroom: hardwood floor, 1 King Bed, 1 Full Sleeper Sofa, master bath with jetted tub and walk-in shower<br>• Guest Bedroom: 1 Queen Bed, private full bath<br><br>3rd Floor:<br>• Master Bedroom: Travertine floor, 1 King Bed, large sofa in the sitting area, master bath with jetted tub and walk-in shower<br>• Guest Bedroom: 1 Queen Bed, private full bath<br><br>*ONLY 2 parking spots available on-site. <br><br>ABOUT LOCATION:<br>• Convenient to beach access, 30A, bike trails, walking paths, and restaurants<br>• Family, pedestrian, and bicycle-friendly community of Seagrove Beach<br>• Seaside is less than a 2-mile drive (or bike ride) away<br><br>**Pool heat is an additional charge per stay. Please contact the office for pricing.<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
